elies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"missing_oracle","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"medium","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"medium"}}},{"block_threshold":0.8,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Resolve the online-vs-offline data-source mismatch: state whether each snapshot-derived observable (orphaned_bindings, orphaned_jira, unbound_local, unbound_jira, discrepancies) is recomputed by its assigned owner (preview/fsck/status) from a LIVE Jira snapshot as reconcile-check does today, or from offline store state — and, if offline, prove the recomputed values match the live-snapshot-derived characterization or record the divergence as a retirement.","cohort":["G6"],"criteria":["G6"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.2789,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["reconcile_check.py __main__ line 237: `jira_snapshot = fetcher.compute_snapshot(pass_id, repo_root)` feeds reconcile_check()","reconcile_check.py line 67-68 docstring: 'reconcile_check is the ONLINE arm of the ONE classifier'","bridge_fsck.schema.json line 5: 'Offline bridge audit emitted by rebar bridge fsck ... binding_drift preserves the classifier's offline report'","Plan step 2 assigns 'orphaned bindings, orphaned Jira references, unbound local/Jira counts' to bridge fsck and 'field-diff discrepancies' to bridge preview"],"finding":"The plan routes reconcile-check's snapshot-derived observables (orphaned_bindings, orphaned_jira, unbound_local, unbound_jira) to bridge fsck and field-diff discrepancies to bridge preview, but reconcile-check computes ALL of these from a LIVE Jira snapshot (fetcher.compute_snapshot; the module docstring calls it 'the ONLINE arm') whereas bridge fsck is documented as an OFFLINE audit ('Offline bridge audit... classifier's offline-decidable cells' in bridge_fsck.schema.json). The plan never states whether the assigned owners recompute these values from a live snapshot or from offline store state, so the routing may assign observables to an owner that structurally cannot reproduce the same values.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"feb9ddc009bc571b0","impact":0.67,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach step 2 (observable-to-owner matrix) and step 3","norm_id":"nb83e2daf081c32ce","priority":0.5211,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A binding whose Jira issue is present in a live snapshot (so reconcile-check computes it as in-sync/checked) vs. fsck's offline view where the Jira issue's live state is unknown — orphaned_bindings/dangling counts diverge","unbound_jira requires enumerating Jira-native issues, which is only knowable from a live fetch, not an offline store audit"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.7778,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"yes","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"module","debt_impact":"medium","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_